reading: if TRUE stays >=0 to the rank edge while BENT (and/or RAND) go NEGATIVE before it, the
sign-survives-to-edge property is SPECIAL to true Lambda = the localized RH-content. The SCALE of
perturbation that first breaks it (5% here) vs the two-floor bound (2C2-1 ~ 0.32 relative) is the
quantitative margin. This is the analytic positivity-bound the second space would have to explain.
